{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27882","headline":"与贾岛顾非熊无可上人宿万年姚少府宅 · 朱庆余","name":"与贾岛顾非熊无可上人宿万年姚少府宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫厌通宵坐，贫中会聚难。\n堂虚雪气入，灯在漏声残。\n役思因生病，当禅岂觉寒。\n开门各有事，非不惜余欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}